1
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:07,160
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:11,840
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:16,160
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:20,440
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,360
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,800
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,800
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:30,680
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,360
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,840
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:40,640
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,600
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,480
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,680
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:49,680
=Episode 15=

17
00:01:19,159 --> 00:01:19,760
Yunluo.

18
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:23,719
Third Uncle.

19
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,959
Did you need something?

20
00:01:26,359 --> 00:01:27,159
Yes.

21
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:31,560
The letter my father sent you was
switched.

22
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,760
I came to warn you.

23
00:01:33,079 --> 00:01:35,200
Someone close to you may be scheming.

24
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,439
How can you be sure it was switched?

25
00:01:38,959 --> 00:01:41,400
I know my father's handwriting.

26
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:45,400
I see.

27
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,640
I'll investigate thoroughly.

28
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:47,719
Good.

29
00:01:47,959 --> 00:01:49,599
Then I'll take my leave.

30
00:01:49,799 --> 00:01:52,879
If you wish to remind me of my place,

31
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,640
just say so.

32
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,359
There's no need

33
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:58,560
to keep calling me uncle.

34
00:01:59,359 --> 00:02:00,560
Oh.

35
00:02:02,239 --> 00:02:04,760
I've lost some of my memories.

36
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:07,400
I don't really remember our past.

37
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:12,560
But I heard you tested medicine on
yourself

38
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:13,879
to save the people from suffering.

39
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:18,039
I hope you can move on.

40
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:23,960
Let the past fade like morning dew.

41
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:30,599
So much for letting the past fade like
morning dew.

42
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:34,800
You only know I tested medicine on
myself.

43
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:38,360
What you don't know is this frail body

44
00:02:40,159 --> 00:02:42,080
has only five years left to live.

45
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,639
Don't worry, Your Majesty.

46
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,680
A dying man like me

47
00:02:49,439 --> 00:02:51,080
has given up all his foolish dreams.

48
00:02:51,639 --> 00:02:53,919
I won't hope for what I can't have.

49
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,039
I remember telling you...

50
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,080
Never mind.

51
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,960
You've forgotten it all anyway.

52
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,960
Thank you for the warning.

53
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:18,919
You helped my family when disaster hit.

54
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,680
For that kindness,

55
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,199
I'll always be grateful.

56
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,479
No need to remember it.

57
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:33,879
Forget it all.

58
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,960
(I'm not crying.)

59
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:47,319
(Are these her lingering feelings?)

60
00:04:06,439 --> 00:04:07,360
Lu Yunluo.

61
00:04:10,919 --> 00:04:11,719
Oh!

62
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,360
What a coincidence!

63
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,680
Why are you here, Your Majesty?

64
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,360
To catch you with another man.

65
00:04:16,879 --> 00:04:18,000
Wait.

66
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:18,920
Prince Chen and I...

67
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,920
We were just...

68
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:27,920
Ji Wujue!

69
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,519
Explain yourself.

70
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:32,160
Explain what?

71
00:04:32,279 --> 00:04:34,240
Meeting another man in secret is
punishable by death.

72
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,240
It wasn't a secret affair!

73
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,519
I met him openly.

74
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:37,800
I...

75
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:40,800
My father had a message for Prince Chen.

76
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:43,439
Then why dress as a palace maid?

77
00:04:44,839 --> 00:04:47,319
The Empress Dowager didn't invite me.
What could I do?

78
00:04:47,519 --> 00:04:48,319
Hmph.

79
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,160
She just wants to humiliate me.

80
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,600
You like money, don't you?

81
00:04:54,319 --> 00:04:55,519
10,000 taels.

82
00:04:55,519 --> 00:04:56,519
Play along with me.

83
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:57,519
What?

84
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:00,920
Since she won't let us appear together,

85
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:04,959
then I'll make sure everyone sees us.

86
00:05:05,959 --> 00:05:06,879
20,000 taels.

87
00:05:06,879 --> 00:05:07,680
Deal.

88
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,519
As you wish.

89
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,879
And another thing.

90
00:05:12,879 --> 00:05:14,319
That luminous pearl you took,

91
00:05:14,319 --> 00:05:15,680
Consort Lan gave it to me.

92
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,560
You can have that too.

93
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,680
Let's go.

94
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:20,560
Wait.

95
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,319
You're going dressed like that?

96
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,160
What?

97
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:26,000
At an occasion like this,

98
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:27,399
my empress

99
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,040
must outshine every woman there.

100
00:05:37,079 --> 00:05:38,319
Wow!

101
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,319
Eunuch Cao.

102
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:43,439
Bring Matron Zhou and Yinshuang here.

103
00:05:43,759 --> 00:05:45,360
I need to prepare properly

104
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:46,439
and surprise Her Majesty.

105
00:05:46,439 --> 00:05:47,160
Yes, Your Majesty.

106
00:05:56,279 --> 00:06:00,879
May Your Majesty enjoy long life and
endless blessings.

107
00:06:00,879 --> 00:06:03,040
(His Majesty the Emperor!)

108
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,879
You've been in the Cold Palace so long,

109
00:06:26,959 --> 00:06:28,920
I'd quite forgotten you.

110
00:06:29,879 --> 00:06:31,160
You have so much on your mind.

111
00:06:32,079 --> 00:06:34,519
The harem, affairs of state...

112
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,759
No wonder you forget things.

113
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:40,519
(Is she implying I meddle in politics?)

114
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,639
It's all right if you've forgotten me.

115
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:45,560
I begged His Majesty

116
00:06:45,759 --> 00:06:48,439
to let me wish you a happy birthday.

117
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,279
Oh?

118
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:54,879
His Majesty gave me a crackled celadon
cup.

119
00:06:55,519 --> 00:06:59,160
Consort Yao, a silk embroidery of the
Eight Immortals.

120
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:03,800
And Consort Lan, gold and jade ornaments
to bring prosperity.

121
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:07,519
What surprise have you brought me?

122
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,600
- What's that?
- It smells so good!

123
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,879
I think it's food.

124
00:07:24,079 --> 00:07:26,279
Food for Her Majesty's birthday?

125
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:28,240
Even a common family's birthday gift

126
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:30,120
wouldn't be so paltry.

127
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,600
Freshly steamed buns.

128
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,600
Still piping hot.

129
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:45,319
You've brought me a steamer of buns?

130
00:07:45,959 --> 00:07:47,079
Two steamers.

131
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,399
Everyone gets a share!

132
00:07:56,920 --> 00:08:00,319
A ruler is entrusted with the people;
food is their first need.

133
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,360
Mother,

134
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:04,040
these buns are filled with my devotion.

135
00:08:04,439 --> 00:08:06,240
May your life be full of joy,

136
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,959
and Donglan flourish and prosper.

137
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:12,480
This new grain yields 10 shi per mu.

138
00:08:12,759 --> 00:08:14,720
Rose red-bean paste, my favorite!

139
00:08:15,319 --> 00:08:16,879
Mine has crab roe and pork.

140
00:08:25,319 --> 00:08:27,079
Mother, do try one.

141
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:29,160
Are they to your liking?

142
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,919
Your Majesty.

143
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:37,559
After all she's said,

144
00:08:37,919 --> 00:08:39,200
refusing her gift

145
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:40,840
would look unseemly.

146
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:03,720
I'm tired.

147
00:09:03,759 --> 00:09:05,080
Enjoy the feast, Your Majesty.

148
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:19,320
You have quite a sharp tongue.

149
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:23,000
Aren't you afraid of offending her?

150
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:25,360
She wants me dead either way.

151
00:09:25,759 --> 00:09:28,080
Why should I put myself through that
just to play nice?

152
00:09:32,679 --> 00:09:35,320
(Open attacks are easy to dodge; hidden
ones are hard to guard against.)

153
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:37,679
(If she won't leave Yunluo alone...)

154
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:40,519
(Yunluo should be free to soar,)

155
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,679
(not trapped in this gilded cage.)

156
00:09:48,759 --> 00:09:50,519
Your Majesty.

157
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,200
Haven't you forgotten something

158
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,840
very, very important?

159
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,399
What is it?

160
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,679
Didn't you promise me

161
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:06,679
20,000 taels for that performance?

162
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,200
So that's why you followed me back.

163
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:14,799
Afraid I wouldn't pay?

164
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:18,399
Of course!

165
00:10:18,399 --> 00:10:19,639
If I wasn't worried you'd refuse to pay,

166
00:10:20,159 --> 00:10:22,000
I wouldn't still be wearing all this.

167
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,159
This headgear is such a hassle.

168
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:48,320
Principal and interest.

169
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,000
23,668 taels.

170
00:10:51,399 --> 00:10:52,360
It's all there.

171
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:56,799
(Since when is this miser so generous?)

172
00:10:57,039 --> 00:10:58,600
(Even the silver and
luminous pearl he took)

173
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,480
(are back.)

174
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:00,759
Hey!

175
00:11:01,679 --> 00:11:02,679
Thank you, Your Majesty.

176
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:06,720
Is the wheat trial going well?

177
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:07,639
Yes.

178
00:11:07,759 --> 00:11:09,120
Is the Agriculture Office cooperating?

179
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,399
It's going great.

180
00:11:11,879 --> 00:11:14,120
The first harvest is about a month away.

181
00:11:18,639 --> 00:11:19,440
Good.

182
00:11:20,759 --> 00:11:21,960
Once the wheat ripens,

183
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:23,919
I will

184
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,840
let you leave the palace.

185
00:11:36,159 --> 00:11:39,399
Why are you letting me go

186
00:11:39,919 --> 00:11:41,120
all of a sudden?

187
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:45,000
I don't want you trapped here,

188
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:47,799
like my mother was.

189
00:11:50,639 --> 00:11:51,720
Oh.

190
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,559
Then...

191
00:11:56,159 --> 00:11:57,879
Thank you, Your Majesty.

192
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,080
Cao Zhongquan.

193
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:09,000
Yes, Your Majesty.

194
00:12:09,679 --> 00:12:10,919
Escort her back.

195
00:12:10,919 --> 00:12:11,679
Yes, Your Majesty.

196
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:16,159
It's pouring outside.

197
00:12:20,679 --> 00:12:23,200
Can I stay here tonight?

198
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,200
You...

199
00:12:30,559 --> 00:12:31,600
You know what that means?

200
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,039
Yes.

201
00:12:33,399 --> 00:12:34,360
I know perfectly well.

202
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,519
Are you truly sure?

203
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,639
In life,

204
00:12:39,639 --> 00:12:41,399
we should enjoy it while we can.

205
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,120
Happiness comes first.

206
00:12:53,799 --> 00:12:54,799
I've made up my mind

207
00:12:55,159 --> 00:12:56,159
to let you leave.

208
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,200
I'll let you leave untouched.

209
00:13:01,399 --> 00:13:02,279
Cao Zhongquan.

210
00:13:03,279 --> 00:13:05,600
Escort the Empress back.

211
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,519
Yes, Your Majesty.

212
00:13:24,879 --> 00:13:26,039
This way, Your Majesty.

213
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:12,400
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

214
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:17,080
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

215
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:21,400
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

216
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:25,840
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

217
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:30,040
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

218
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:34,440
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

219
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:38,240
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

220
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:43,400
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

221
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:47,200
♪No finery to rival spring♪

222
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:51,680
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

223
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:55,800
♪Where is beauty found?♪

224
00:14:55,960 --> 00:15:00,520
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

225
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:02,560
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

226
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:04,720
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

227
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:07,160
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

228
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:09,160
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

229
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:11,040
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

230
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:13,720
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

231
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:16,200
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

232
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:20,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
